{"id":"70d2d03fcf019c44","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-prop-cofinality-inequality.md","title":"Cofinality Inequality","display":"prop-cofinality-inequality — Cofinality Inequality","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-cofinality-inequality","aliases":["58-prop-cofinality-inequality"],"display":"prop-cofinality-inequality — Cofinality Inequality","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-thm-cantor]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-cofinality-inequality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-cofinality-inequality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-cofinality-inequality — Cofinality Inequality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d080919eadef61c1\" href=\"?note=d080919eadef61c1\" title=\"58-thm-cantor\">58-thm-cantor</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (infinite cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (cardinal predicate and cofinality function)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cofinality\\text{-}inequality} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa))\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)&lt;2^{\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cofinality\\text{-}inequality} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa))\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)&lt;2^{\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first inequality follows from the identity map on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; the strict second inequality is Cantor's theorem applied to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-cantor","status":"resolved","id":"d080919eadef61c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-cantor]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}cofinality\\text{-}inequality} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa))\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)<2^{\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)","display":false}],"bytes":933,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3945","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-prop-cofinality-inequality.md|58-prop-cofinality-inequality]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["315ad00b8744fdfc","5fb1c2241d1943d1","d080919eadef61c1"]}